      <activity id="0177e741-a3e7-5d57-a208-d8551f8bdcd6" activityNameId="a2177f27-1111-57df-a5ca-b0634ec953eb" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Process specific emissions and resources, from uranium milling, at mill plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Process specific emissions and resources, from uranium milling, at mill plant
PSI data (BFE project 407, Christian Bauer, April 2012).;
UUID: 3653b40f-90e6-3e41-a90f-9a8a6a7f1728
The module includes: the land use for the operation (mostly tailings); diesel generators and  industrial boilers burning light oil; transport of the chemicals and fuels; radioactive and non-radioactive emissions to air and water during operation; water use (mining water, but attributed to "unspecified natural origin").
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average conditions.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3653b40f-90e6-3e41-a90f-9a8a6a7f1728.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
